{"data":{"body":"**P3:** Completing `update` directly does not unregister it from `CheckpointManager.pollingFutures`. If READY arrives between the initial state read and poll registration, the scheduled batch still sees a poller and can issue an unnecessary backend request; the entry can remain until shutdown when that response omits the operation. Add an explicit unregister path or prune completed pollers before batching, and test this race by asserting no extra client call occurs.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774R0s","finding_digest":"58999337e70e61f15773ad6dbbe1814d7728b4e8111c2b58e523379f6f798503","finding_id":"arf_v1_lcmzgn7hbzq7cv3tvvw3xymbjv","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::polluntilready::completed-poll-registration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/waitforconditionoperation.java::polluntilready::completed-poll-registration-leak","line":126,"observation_digest":"1d8be16d3e54da3e9b21001787dcb8498403b89aa407fdf98a6cfee41e09dfde","observation_id":"aro_v1_dwf6c3j6ktnd5gzbaalypxfyjg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/WaitForConditionOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_lcmzgn7hbzq7cv3tvvw3xymbjv","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:21Z","review_id":"arr_v1_cu4zeb5k3rkfj3fado7e3kadxg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"eb449c4cada52414f687bb5b3ae9362a917448f2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_47fd5cgyqxdtkuajrejlz2clng","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:21Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
